// BIBLE_TYPECHECK
//
// Scoped typecheck for the migrated Bellbound Dragon quest catalog and its
// tests.
//
//   node_modules/.bin/tsc -p tsconfig.biblecheck.json
//   scripts/harthmere/t.sh types:bible
//
// IMPORTANT: ts-node runs with transpileOnly + swc (see the "ts-node" block in
// tsconfig.json), so `./b test` and `t.sh bible` do NOT typecheck. 105 green
// Bible tests say nothing about type correctness. This config is the other
// half and takes a few seconds.
//
// Everything under src/shared/harthmere/bible/ is intentionally in scope: the
// module set is closed (pure data + pure functions, no server/client/ECS-gen
// value imports), which is exactly what makes both this typecheck and the fast
// test preset cheap. If adding a file here makes this config slow, that file
// has pulled in a heavy graph and belongs outside the directory.
{
  "extends": "./tsconfig.json",
  "compilerOptions": { "noEmit": true, "incremental": false },
  "include": [
    "src/shared/harthmere/bible/*.ts",
    "src/shared/harthmere/test/bible_*.test.ts",
    "modules.d.ts"
  ]
}
